#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:131
msgid ""
"Port NINA/RP2 WiFi code to the standard :class:`network.WLAN` interface "
"(``WLAN(interface)``, ``active()``, ``essid=``) and expect a tuple from "
"``nina.fw_version()`` (:ref:`the WiFi API change <v4_1_0_wifi>`)."
msgstr ""
"Siirrä NINA/RP2 WiFi-koodi standardiin :class:`network.WLAN` -rajapintaan "
"(\\ ``WLAN(interface)``\\ , ``active()``\\ , ``essid=``\\ ) ja varaudu "
"siihen, että ``nina.fw_version()`` palauttaa monikon (\\ :ref:`WiFi-API:n "
"muutos <v4_1_0_wifi>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"Change ``except ValueError`` to ``except RuntimeError`` around camera / "
":func:`sensor.reset` error handling (:ref:`the sensor-error change "
"<v4_1_0_errors>`)."
msgstr ""
"Vaihda ``except ValueError`` muotoon ``except RuntimeError`` kameran / "
":func:`sensor.reset` -virheenkäsittelyn ympärillä (\\ :ref:`sensorivirheiden"
" muutos <v4_1_0_errors>`\\ )."
